WEBVTT

00:00:11.025 --> 00:00:14.237
(crackling)

00:00:36.592 --> 00:00:39.720
Don't suppose you have
any matches, do you?

00:00:41.722 --> 00:00:43.057
No, but...

00:00:44.183 --> 00:00:45.643
...would this help?

00:00:45.726 --> 00:00:48.562
You might have mentioned
that a bit sooner.

00:01:30.646 --> 00:01:33.482
I can't believe it. It's all still here.

00:01:46.996 --> 00:01:49.540
(Lucy) I was so tall.

00:01:49.623 --> 00:01:52.376
Well, you
were older then.

00:01:52.460 --> 00:01:56.547
As opposed to hundreds of years
later... when you're younger.

00:02:10.603 --> 00:02:12.855
- (Lucy) What is it?
- My horn.

00:02:12.938 --> 00:02:16.400
I must've left it on my saddle
the day we went back.

00:02:38.005 --> 00:02:41.509
When Aslan bares his teeth,
winter meets its death.

00:02:43.135 --> 00:02:44.970
When he shakes his mane...

00:02:46.847 --> 00:02:48.516
...we shall have spring again.

00:02:52.520 --> 00:02:57.900
Everyone we knew...
Mr. Tumnus and the Beavers...

00:03:00.653 --> 00:03:01.904
...they're all gone.

00:03:09.203 --> 00:03:11.705
I think it's time we
found out what's going on.

00:03:25.136 --> 00:03:26.804
He won't stop staring.

00:03:27.513 --> 00:03:28.848
So don't look.

00:03:42.194 --> 00:03:43.863
Here's far enough.

00:03:53.247 --> 00:03:54.498
Drop him!

00:03:54.582 --> 00:03:56.917
Crows and crockery!

00:04:02.214 --> 00:04:03.799
(grunting)

00:04:31.952 --> 00:04:34.622
(gagging)

00:04:39.710 --> 00:04:41.295
"Drop him"!

00:04:43.881 --> 00:04:46.383
That's the best
you can come up with?

00:04:46.467 --> 00:04:48.552
A simple "thank you"
would suffice.

00:04:48.636 --> 00:04:51.514
They were doing fine
drowning me without your help.

00:04:51.597 --> 00:04:53.307
Maybe we should have let them.

00:04:54.642 --> 00:04:56.477
Why were they trying
to kill you, anyway?

00:04:58.145 --> 00:05:01.065
They're Telmarines.
That's what they do.

00:05:01.148 --> 00:05:04.360
Telmarines? In Narnia?

00:05:04.443 --> 00:05:07.571
Where have you been
for the last few hundred years?

00:05:08.572 --> 00:05:10.199
It's a bit of a long story.

00:05:19.667 --> 00:05:22.586
Oh, you've got
to be kidding me.

00:05:24.296 --> 00:05:25.923
You're it?

00:05:26.006 --> 00:05:28.926
You're the kings
and queens of old?

00:05:30.219 --> 00:05:32.763
High King Peter,
the Magnificent.

00:05:34.014 --> 00:05:36.016
You probably could've
left off the last bit.

00:05:36.725 --> 00:05:40.104
(laughing) Probably.

00:05:41.188 --> 00:05:42.481
You might be surprised.

00:05:44.525 --> 00:05:47.444
Oh, you don't want
to do that, boy.

00:05:47.528 --> 00:05:49.530
Not me. Him.

